#: ../../source/modele.rst:4
msgid "Modèle de données"
msgstr "Data model"

#: ../../source/modele.rst:6
msgid "Tous les types de cette page appartiennent au paquet ``tournoi``."
msgstr "All types on this page belong to the ``tournoi`` package."

#: ../../source/modele.rst:9
msgid "Identifiants et joueurs"
msgstr "Identifiers and players"

#: ../../source/modele.rst:23
msgid ""
"``BYE`` est une valeur réservée : aucun joueur inscrit ne peut porter cet"
" identifiant. Le moteur ne le vérifie pas (``player_added`` ne refuse "
"qu'un identifiant vide) ; c'est à l'hôte de l'interdire."
msgstr ""
"``BYE`` is a reserved value: no registered player may use this "
"identifier. The engine does not check this (``player_added`` only rejects"
" an empty identifier); it is up to the host to forbid it."

#: ../../source/modele.rst:26
msgid ""
"Le ``Rating`` n'intervient ni dans l'appariement d'un suisse, d'un bloc "
"GSL ou d'une poule, ni dans le classement. Il sert dans trois cas "
"seulement :"
msgstr ""
"The ``Rating`` plays no part in the pairing of a Swiss, a GSL block or a "
"pool, nor in the standings. It is used in only three cases:"

#: ../../source/modele.rst:29
msgid ""
"le tirage d'un tableau dont la phase a ``seeding: \"rating\"`` (placement"
" classique par cote, ``rules.SeedOrder``) ; par défaut (``seeding`` "
"vide), le tirage est aléatoire et ignore la cote, conformément au "
"principe « pas de têtes de série protégées » ;"
msgstr ""
"the draw of a bracket whose phase has ``seeding: \"rating\"`` (classic "
"placement by rating, ``rules.SeedOrder``); by default (empty "
"``seeding``), the draw is random and ignores the rating, in line with the"
" \"no protected seeds\" principle;"

#: ../../source/modele.rst:32
msgid ""
"la simulation (``sim.Run``) et la prévision de fin (``sim.Forecast``), où"
" une cote inconnue est remplacée par la moyenne des cotes connues, ou 6 "
"(``rules.MeanRating``) ;"
msgstr ""
"the simulation (``sim.Run``) and the end-time forecast "
"(``sim.Forecast``), where an unknown rating is replaced by the mean of "
"the known ratings, or 6 (``rules.MeanRating``);"

#: ../../source/modele.rst:34
msgid "l'affichage."
msgstr "display."

#: ../../source/modele.rst:37
msgid "Match"
msgstr "Match"

#: ../../source/modele.rst:70
msgid "Méthodes :"
msgstr "Methods:"

#: ../../source/modele.rst:72
msgid ""
"``Loser() PlayerID`` : renvoie ``B`` si ``Winner == A``, sinon ``A``. "
"**N'est valide que pour un match terminé** ; sur un match non terminé "
"elle renvoie ``A`` (puisque ``Winner`` est vide)."
msgstr ""
"``Loser() PlayerID``: returns ``B`` if ``Winner == A``, otherwise ``A``. "
"**Valid only for a finished match**; on an unfinished match it returns "
"``A`` (since ``Winner`` is empty)."

#: ../../source/modele.rst:74
msgid "``Has(p PlayerID) bool`` : ``A == p || B == p``."
msgstr "``Has(p PlayerID) bool``: ``A == p || B == p``."

#: ../../source/modele.rst:76
msgid ""
"Un match est relié à son emplacement dans un graphe par le couple "
"(``Section``, ``Key``). ``Key`` est vide pour un match libre, apparié "
"dynamiquement hors graphe : suisse (continu ou par rondes), finale GSL et"
" barrage. ``Section`` est vide aussi pour le suisse et la finale GSL ; un"
" match de barrage porte le nom de sa section (``barrage:A``), sans "
"``Key``."
msgstr ""
"A match is tied to its location in a graph by the pair (``Section``, "
"``Key``). ``Key`` is empty for a free match, paired dynamically outside "
"any graph: Swiss (continuous or by rounds), GSL final and play-off. "
"``Section`` is also empty for the Swiss and the GSL final; a play-off "
"match carries the name of its section (``barrage:A``), with no ``Key``."

#: ../../source/modele.rst:81
#, no-python-brace-format
msgid ""
"``Section`` est un **identifiant**, jamais un texte à afficher : "
"``main``, ``conso``, ``last``, ``gf`` (tableaux), ``B<bloc>G<groupe>`` "
"(GSL), ``poule:A``, ``poule:B``… (poules), ``barrage:A``… (barrage de la "
"poule A). ``Label`` est un libellé **structuré** (``Label{Kind, N, "
"Losses, Match, Section, Text, Players, Spots, Sub}``, ``codes.go``) que "
"l'hôte traduit ; seul ``Text`` porte du texte, et seulement ce que le TD "
"a saisi (nom de phase)."
msgstr ""
"``Section`` is an **identifier**, never display text: ``main``, "
"``conso``, ``last``, ``gf`` (brackets), ``B<bloc>G<groupe>`` (GSL), "
"``poule:A``, ``poule:B``... (pools), ``barrage:A``... (play-off of pool "
"A). ``Label`` is a **structured** label (``Label{Kind, N, Losses, Match, "
"Section, Text, Players, Spots, Sub}``, ``codes.go``) that the host "
"translates; only ``Text`` carries text, and only what the TD entered "
"(phase name)."

#: ../../source/modele.rst:88
msgid "Rang"
msgstr "Rank"

#: ../../source/modele.rst:108
msgid ""
"La note est un **code** et ses paramètres, jamais une phrase : "
"``winner``, ``finalist``, ``alive`` (``Lives``), ``record`` (``Wins``, "
"``Losses``), ``forfeit``, ``withdrawn``, ``running``, ``awaiting_draw``, "
"``unranked``, ``section_exit`` (``Section`` + ``Sub``), "
"``section_winner``, ``pool_record`` (``Section``, ``Wins``, "
"``Qualified``) — valeurs exactes dans ``rules/codes.go``. Le rendu "
"français (``Note.String()``, ``fr.go``) ne sert que la console, la démo "
"et ``render``. Voir :ref:`classement`."
msgstr ""
"The note is a **code** and its parameters, never a sentence: ``winner``, "
"``finalist``, ``alive`` (``Lives``), ``record`` (``Wins``, ``Losses``), "
"``forfeit``, ``withdrawn``, ``running``, ``awaiting_draw``, ``unranked``,"
" ``section_exit`` (``Section`` + ``Sub``), ``section_winner``, "
"``pool_record`` (``Section``, ``Wins``, ``Qualified``) — exact values in "
"``rules/codes.go``. The French rendering (``Note.String()``, ``fr.go``) "
"serves only the console, the demo and ``render``. See :ref:`classement`."

#: ../../source/modele.rst:116
msgid "Action"
msgstr "Action"

#: ../../source/modele.rst:150
msgid ""
"``Label``, ``Reason`` (``matches_running``, ``no_pairing``, "
"``waiting_batch``, ``waiting_table``, ``player_unavailable``, "
"``player_busy``) et ``Warn`` sont des codes. ``Action.String()`` (rendu "
"français, pour la console) produit une phrase destinée au TD :"
msgstr ""
"``Label``, ``Reason`` (``matches_running``, ``no_pairing``, "
"``waiting_batch``, ``waiting_table``, ``player_unavailable``, "
"``player_busy``) and ``Warn`` are codes. ``Action.String()`` (French "
"rendering, for the console) produces a sentence intended for the TD:"

